      "help_en": "The list of snapshot job IDs.\n\nYou can query up to 10 jobs at a time. Separate multiple IDs with commas (,).\n\nYou can obtain the job IDs from the MPS console (https://mps.console.aliyun.com/overview) by choosing Task Management > Snapshots. You can also obtain them from the response parameters of the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/602857.html operation",
